### TalentBridge Search API — public reads (no auth) + internal projection
@host = http://localhost:5002

### Health
GET {{host}}/health
###
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Default board: open, unexpired, newest first
GET {{host}}/api/jobs

### Keyword (tsvector) + relevance ranking
GET {{host}}/api/jobs?q=warehouse+supervisor&sort=relevance

### Multi-select facets, salary range, recency, paging (pageSize ≤ 50)
GET {{host}}/api/jobs?department=Operations&department=Transport&workArrangement=Hybrid&salaryMin=35000&salaryMax=60000&postedWithinDays=30&sort=salaryDesc&page=1&pageSize=20

### Unknown sort → 400 (never a silent default)
GET {{host}}/api/jobs?sort=newest

### Facet counts for the current query (each dimension counted with its own filter excluded)
GET {{host}}/api/facets?department=Operations

### Detail by slug → 200 with ETag; repeat with If-None-Match → 304
# @name detail
GET {{host}}/api/jobs/senior-warehouse-supervisor-leeds

###
GET {{host}}/api/jobs/senior-warehouse-supervisor-leeds
If-None-Match: {{detail.response.headers.ETag}}

### Unknown slug → 404
GET {{host}}/api/jobs/does-not-exist

### Internal: projection upsert (needs Projection__SharedSecret from .env)
POST {{host}}/internal/projections/job
X-Projection-Secret: {{$dotenv Projection__SharedSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
